WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:17.334
The robot arm moves down to grasp the right moka pot by its handle, lifts it, and places it onto the front-left burner of the stove. The arm then retracts, leaving the left moka pot on the table.

2
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000
Move arm down and forward to approach the right moka pot, then close the gripper to grasp the handle.

3
00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:10.000
Lift the grasped moka pot and move it to the right, positioning it over the front-left burner of the stove.

4
00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:17.000
Lower the moka pot onto the stove burner, open the gripper to release it, and retract the arm upwards.
